      "mergeID": "5bbfd3e934d04545e8ec7c08",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Add enabling/disabling Cameras on Avatars to the Safety System.\n\nI know right now you need to friend people in order to see their cameras, but this would be much easier, since you wouldn't need to friend everyone you want to show a animation with a camera or so.",
